    "text": "<div class=creature>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-title\"><span>{{!!title}}</span><span>2级 蛮战</span></div>\n<div class=bg-title><span>中型 元素界 类人生物（恶魔）</span><span>XP {{!!xp}}</span></div>\n<div><span>''HP'' 42；''重伤'' 21</span><span>''先攻'' +1</span></div>\n<div><span>''AC'' 14，''强韧'' 14，''反射'' 13，''意志'' 12</span><span>''侦查'' +2</span></div>\n<div><span>''速度'' 6</span><span>''感官'' 黑暗视觉</span></div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">特性</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/aura}}血盆大口✦灵气 1</div>\n<div class=description>该灵气内的敌人提供战斗优势。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">标准动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">{{$:/dnd/images/meleebasic}}啮咬✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>攻击：近战 1（一个生物）+5vs.AC<br>命中：1d12+5 伤害。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">移动动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">贪婪进攻✦随意</div>\n<div class=description>效果：该胃魔快步五格到一个邻接着最近的重伤敌人的格子。</div>\n<div class=\"bold font-size-h4 bg-category\">触发动作</div>\n<div class=\"bold bg-power\">可变抗性✦遭遇</div>\n<div class=description>触发：该胃魔受到强酸、寒冷、火焰、闪电或雷鸣伤害。<br>效果（自由动作）：该胃魔获得 10 点触发的伤害类型的抗性直到遭遇结束。</div>\n<div class=\"italic bg-flavortext\">（胃魔）</div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''力量'' 17（+4）</span><span>''敏捷'' 11（+1）</span><span>''感知'' 13（+2）</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"bg-power\"><div class=\"ability\"><span>''体质'' 12（+2）</span><span>''智力'' 5（-2）</span><span>''魅力'' 6（-1）</span></div></div>\n<div><div class=\"ability\"><span>''阵营'' 混乱邪恶</span><span style=flex-basis:auto>''语言'' 能理解深渊语</span></div></div>\n</div>",
